{
    "test_name": "MOB.331_Work_GenInfo_Value_Modal",
    "details": {
        "name": "MOB.331_Work_GenInfo_Value_Modal",
        "type": "browser",
        "status": "paused",
        "message": "`MOB.331` **The arrow beside a multiline field opens its full value.**\n- General Info's Stage Notes (`desc` = `DATADOG FIXTURE`) carries the arrow; Problem Description\n  (`problemDesc`, empty) does not \u2014 `MultiLineLabel` renders nothing for an empty value, so\n  the pair is a biconditional read at once.\n- Clicking it opens a modal showing exactly `DATADOG FIXTURE` \u2014 the field's VALUE, not its label.\n- \u26a0\ufe0f The onClick is on the icon, not the button (whose `aria-label` is `Settings`), so the\n  click is dispatched on the <svg>.\n- Read-only: a modal opened and closed, nothing typed.",
        "tags": [
            "Mobile",
            "env:dev",
            "Work Order",
            "read-only",
            "module:work-orders"
        ],
        "locations": [
            "gcp:us-west2"
        ],
        "config": {
            "assertions": [],
            "config_variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "request": {
                "headers": {},
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{ MOBDEV }}"
            },
            "variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "set_cookie": ""
        },
        "options": {
